WEBVTT

00:06:59.669 --> 00:07:02.672
would have a brain of about 1.2 kilos,

00:07:02.672 --> 00:07:04.561
which seems just right,

00:07:04.561 --> 00:07:06.533
in a body of some 66 kilos,

00:07:06.533 --> 00:07:09.178
which in my case is exactly right,

00:07:09.178 --> 00:07:11.798
which brings us to a very unsurprising

00:07:11.798 --> 00:07:14.767
but still incredibly important conclusion:

00:07:14.767 --> 00:07:16.108
I am a primate.

00:07:16.108 --> 00:07:18.806
And all of you are primates.

00:07:18.806 --> 00:07:20.706
And so was Darwin.

00:07:20.706 --> 00:07:23.646
I love to think that Darwin
would have really appreciated this.

00:07:23.646 --> 00:07:25.613
His brain, like ours,

00:07:25.613 --> 00:07:29.124
was made in the image of other primate brains.

00:07:29.124 --> 00:07:31.426
So the human brain may be remarkable, yes,